      "message": "Alternate implementation that delays for 3 seconds when the LED is off....might save a little power.\n\nstatic void suspend_led_update(void)\n{\n        int delay \u003d 50 * MSEC;\n\n        ticks++;\n\n        /* 1s gradual on, 1s gradual off, 3s off */\n        if (ticks \u003c\u003d 20) {\n                pwm_set_duty(PWM_CH_LED_RED, ticks*5);\n        } else if (ticks \u003c\u003d 40) {\n                pwm_set_duty(PWM_CH_LED_RED, (40 - ticks)*5);\n        } else {\n                ticks \u003d 0;\n                delay \u003d 3000 * MSEC;\n        }\n\n        hook_call_deferred(suspend_led_update, delay);\n}",
